<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Fujimi rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fujimi rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd has assigned Fujimi Inc a &quot;2&quot; rating, Nikko brokers said on Monday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;2&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the key 225-share Nikkeei average over the next six months.</p>
</text>
